kGroupRows*(n+1)*32*4 = 4*9*32*4 = 4608
kGroupRows*Align(1024*2) = 4*2048 = 8192
kGroupRows*Align(128*4) = 4*512 = 2048
Total = 32768+16384+16384+4608+8192+2048 = 80384 ≤ 153600 ✓

So group_ = true for Case5. Confirmed. And cnt=1. Dead.

